<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>FestAtlas Support</title>
<style>
  body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 20px;line-height:1.6;color:#1c1c1e;background:#fff}
  h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 4px}
  h2{font-size:18px;margin:28px 0 6px}
  p,li{font-size:16px}
  a{color:#534ab7}
  .sub{color:#6b6b70;margin:0 0 24px}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{background:#111;color:#eee}.sub{color:#a0a0a8}a{color:#a79cff}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>FestAtlas Support</h1>
<p class="sub">Help with your account, reports and the app.</p>

<h2>Contact us</h2>
<p>Email <a href="mailto:festatlas1@gmail.com">festatlas1@gmail.com</a>. We reply within a few days, and we review reports of abusive content or users within 24 hours.</p>

<h2>I forgot my password</h2>
<p>Email us from the address you signed up with, and we'll send you a temporary password. Change it in Profile after you sign in.</p>

<h2>Delete my account</h2>
<p>Open the Profile tab and choose Delete Account. This permanently removes your profile, picks, seen sets, ratings and follows.</p>

<h2>Report or block someone</h2>
<p>Open the person's profile in Friends and use the menu to report or block them. You can also email us with the details. We act on reports within 24 hours, and may remove content or accounts that break the <a href="https://mccarthy2324.github.io/festatlas-legal/terms">Terms</a>.</p>

<h2>Something is missing or wrong</h2>
<p>If a lineup, date or artist is wrong or missing, email us with the festival, year and what to fix. We update the data as fast as we can.</p>

<h2>Notifications</h2>
<p>You choose what to be notified about in Profile, under Notifications. If you turned notifications off in iOS, re-enable them in Settings, then FestAtlas.</p>

<h2>Privacy and terms</h2>
<p><a href="https://mccarthy2324.github.io/festatlas-legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href="https://mccarthy2324.github.io/festatlas-legal/terms">Terms</a></p>

<p class="sub" style="margin-top:32px">FestAtlas is an independent app and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any festival. Festival names and logos belong to their owners.</p>
</body>
</html>
